{
  "file" : "npc/instances/EndlessTower.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^008800Wait here!!",
      "translation" : "^008800请稍候！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're carrying too much stuff. Why don't you put some of it away, and then come back.^000000",
      "translation" : "你携带的东西太多了。先收起一部分，再回来吧。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sigh... I don't know if I can ever go back to sailing the sea...",
      "translation" : "唉...我不知道自己还能不能再回到海上航行..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffLooking incredibly excited, the old man ran into the marine shop hurriedly ordering goods. You don't have anything better to do, so you decide to ask him why he is in such a rush.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老人看起来兴奋不已，急匆匆地跑进船具店订购物资。你正好没什么事，便决定问问他为何如此匆忙。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe old man, after finishing his orders, walks towards you.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老人订购完物资后，朝你走来。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was touched when you accepted a request from me, a stranger, so easily. You must truly be one of those good, heroic adventurers. Are you interested in setting out on an ocean voyage?",
      "translation" : "一个陌生人提出请求，你却这么爽快地答应了，我很感动。你一定是那种善良又勇敢的冒险者。想不想出海航行？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've sailed a few times... But now that I think about it, I've never gone across the continent.",
      "translation" : "我出过几次海...不过现在想想，我还从没横渡过大陆之外的海洋。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, that's good enough. I may just have one small fishing vessel, but I used to be a captain that commanded a fleet.",
      "translation" : "那就足够了。我虽然只有一艘小小的渔船，但以前可是统领舰队的船长。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As you may know after a few sea voyages, not many people have gone across the ocean beyond the continent. I too have failed to conquer the ocean.",
      "translation" : "你出海几次后应该也知道，横渡大陆之外海洋的人寥寥无几。我也没能征服那片海洋。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffMr. Janssen talked about his perilous ocean journeys for quite a while. You have enough time on your hands, so you sit down, quietly listening to his story.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff詹森先生讲述了许久危险的航海经历。你时间充裕，便坐下来静静听他讲述。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffAt least half of his story sounded grossly exaggerated, but something caught your ear: he insists that a humongous tower exists on the ocean, and that it's so tall, it scrapes across the sky.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff他的故事至少有一半听起来夸张得离谱，不过有件事引起了你的注意：他坚称海上有一座巨塔，高耸入云，直插天际。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So all I could do was cast anchor at that humongous tower after my fleet was wrecked. At first, we were only going to stay there until the rainstorm was over, but it didn't end as soon as we had hoped.",
      "translation" : "舰队遇难后，我只能在那座巨塔旁抛锚。起初我们打算等暴风雨过去就离开，可雨迟迟没有停。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My crew was starving, and a few of them walked into the tower in order to find food... They never came back.",
      "translation" : "船员们饿坏了，有几个人走进塔里寻找食物...他们再也没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why didn't you go in there with them?",
      "translation" : "你为什么不和他们一起进去？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My instincts told me that tower was dangerous. I was curious, but I wasn't going to risk my life. We waited for them to come back for 7 days until the rainstorm was finally over, but no one returned.",
      "translation" : "我的直觉告诉我那座塔很危险。虽然我很好奇，但不想拿性命冒险。我们等了七天，暴风雨终于停了，可他们始终没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In our desperation to survive, we abandoned all our goods, and left the tower only with a little bit of the water and edible plants we'd found around the tower. When we finally reached land, I was the only one alive...",
      "translation" : "为了活下去，我们只能放弃所有物资，只带上少量水和在塔附近找到的可食用植物。终于抵达陆地时，只有我一个人活了下来..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffYou could imagine the heartwretching scene of the dying fleet on their last voyage, even if he didn't explain it any further. A look of somber regret swept over his face as he remained silent a while, and then he said:^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff即使他没有继续说明，你也能想象那支舰队在最后一次航行中走向毁灭的悲惨景象。他沉默片刻，脸上掠过深深的悔恨，随后说道：^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have something I must do before I die. I must retrieve the remains of my crew that died in the tower, and give them a proper burial.",
      "translation" : "我死前还有一件必须完成的事。我得找回死在塔里的船员遗骸，为他们好好安葬。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I feel so lucky to meet a warm-hearted adventurer like you. With the money you've given me, I can finally go sailing to the tower again.",
      "translation" : "能遇见你这样热心的冒险者，我真是太幸运了。有了你给我的钱，我终于能再次乘船前往那座塔。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How about hiring me as your first mate?",
      "translation" : "雇我当你的大副怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you, but it is an extremely dangerous place. I have my duty to fulfill, but you don't have any obligation to me or them. I don't wish to sacrifice someone as young as you to such a dangerous place.",
      "translation" : "谢谢你，但那里极其危险。我有必须完成的责任，可你对我和他们都没有任何义务。我不想让你这么年轻就葬身在那种危险的地方。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No...",
      "translation" : "不..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : ".",
      "translation" : "。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : ".",
      "translation" : "。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As an adventurer, there's my obligation to those in need. I'm also very curious about that place...",
      "translation" : "作为冒险者，我有责任帮助有困难的人。而且我也很好奇那个地方..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was going to leave right away, but since you've joined me, I should give you time to prepare. I'll be waiting here until you're ready to go.",
      "translation" : "我本打算立刻出发，不过既然你要和我一起去，我应该给你时间准备。准备好之前，我会一直在这里等你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...Okay then...",
      "translation" : "...那好吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome aboard, first mate.",
      "translation" : "欢迎上船，大副。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Shall we leave now?",
      "translation" : "我们现在出发吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, let's go!",
      "translation" : "好，走吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, I'm not quite ready...",
      "translation" : "不，我还没准备好..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then pull up the anchor, first mate!",
      "translation" : "那就起锚吧，大副！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure, no problem. Come back when you're ready.",
      "translation" : "当然没问题。准备好之后再来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, to travel the ocean again, we need to restock on goods. If you give me 10,000 Zeny, I'll take care of the rest.",
      "translation" : "要再次出海，我们得补充物资。你给我10,000 ZENY，剩下的交给我处理。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll come back later.",
      "translation" : "我晚点再来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's go, now!",
      "translation" : "现在就出发！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but I don't have that much money. I'll come back when I save enough.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我没那么多钱。等我存够了再回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure, no problem. I'll be waiting for your return.",
      "translation" : "当然没问题。我会等你回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you don't have enough money. I need at least 10,000 Zeny to restock our supplies...",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你的钱不够。补充物资至少需要10,000 ZENY..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excellent! Now we're good to go. Let's pull up the anchor again!",
      "translation" : "太好了！现在可以出发了。再起锚吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excuse me, are you an adventurer?",
      "translation" : "打扰一下，你是冒险者吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry to ask you this, especially when this is the first time we've ever met, but can you do me a favor? I'll make it short.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我们才刚认识就提出请求，不过能帮我一个忙吗？我长话短说。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you donate ^0000ff10,000 Zeny^000000 to me? It's for a cause that's important to me...",
      "translation" : "可以捐给我^0000ff10,000 ZENY^000000吗？这笔钱对我有很重要的用途..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No!",
      "translation" : "不行！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure thing.",
      "translation" : "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@name$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you've got the wrong person to ask that.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你问错人了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Captain Janssen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Captain Janssen]",
      "translation" : "[詹森船长]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
